Further, based on the recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee, the Board of Directors of the Company, at its meeting held today, has approved the appointment of Ms. Anuradha Rao (DIN: 07597195) as an Additional Director (Non-Executive, Non-Independent) of the Company for a further period of one year with effect from October 31, 2026, subject to the approval of the shareholders. 
Ms. Anuradha Rao shall also continue to serve as a Member of the respective Committees of the Company with effect from the aforesaid date.
